    "SDK/toolchain are identified by actual hashes/version, not a permanent pinned reference environment.",
    "AddStyle duplicate naming, CopyStyles append/self behavior, native allocation/failure/reentry, serializer bytes and host rendering require separate full-class gates."
  ],
